\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Layer 2 Outflow Bottleneck Analysis (controlled ablation with fixed $A_j$ heuristic and national decay prior). \textbf  {Left}: Source-scale robustness learning curve --- mean CPC $\pm 1\sigma $ as the number of source cities used to train $\mathrm  {GBDT}_O$ increases from 5 to 25. CPC saturates by $n_{\text  {src}} \approx 15$--20. \textbf  {Right}: Noise sensitivity --- mean CPC $\pm 1\sigma $ across 25 held-out cities under additive Gaussian noise $\sigma \in \{0\%, 10\%, 20\%, 40\%\}$ injected on $\log \hat  {O}_i$.}}{14}{figure.8}\protected@file@percent }
